    "text": "If the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math>,&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> equals",
